      "content": "thanks for that. so if i want them to really understand the 'revolutionary' side, could you expand on that? i'd love a list of the core arguments or values that make certain movements 'progressive' and 'revolutionary' compared to those other ones you mentioned. basically, what are the strongest points or driving principles that define that side of the spectrum?",
